msgstr "登録済みジョブを PC 群に対して起動。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/index.md:33
msgid "`kanade agent publish <file>`"
msgstr "`kanade agent publish <file>`"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/index.md:33
msgid "Upload an agent binary (version extracted from PE VERSIONINFO)."
msgstr ""
"agent バイナリをアップロード (バージョンは PE VERSIONINFO から自動抽出)。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/index.md:34
msgid "`kanade agent rollout <version> --pc \\| --group \\| --global`"
msgstr "`kanade agent rollout <version> --pc \\| --group \\| --global`"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/index.md:34
msgid ""
"Flip `target_version` on the chosen scope; agents pick it up via their self-"
"update watcher."
msgstr ""
"指定スコープの `target_version` を切り替え。各 agent は self-update watcher "
"経由でこれを拾います。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:3
msgid ""
"The backend lives on one (or more) of your managed hosts as a Windows "
"service. Agent-mediated update means: an agent running on that host stops "
"the service, swaps the binary, starts it back up — while the operator never "
"logs into the host."
msgstr ""
"backend は管理対象ホスト 1 台 (またはそれ以上) で Windows サービスとして動い"
"ています。agent 経由のアップデートとは、そのホスト上で稼働する agent がサービ"
"スを停止し、バイナリを差し替えて再起動することを指します。これにより、"
"operator は対象ホストに一度もログインする必要がありません。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:8
msgid "End-to-end flow"
msgstr "end-to-end フロー"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:41
msgid ""
"The two sha checks are intentional: the script body's hash is verified by "
"the agent before execution (script integrity); the binary's hash is verified "
"by the script before the swap (binary integrity, defined by the operator in "
"`$AgentSourceSha256`)."
msgstr ""
"sha チェックが 2 段ある理由は意図的: スクリプト本体のハッシュは agent が実行"
"前に検証 (スクリプトの完全性)、バイナリのハッシュはスクリプトが swap 前に検"
"証 (バイナリの完全性、operator が `$AgentSourceSha256` で指定)。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:47
#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/client.md:28
#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md:33
msgid "Step-by-step"
msgstr "ステップごとの手順"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:49
msgid "1. Build kanade-backend"
msgstr "1. kanade-backend をビルド"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:55
msgid "Output: `target/release/kanade-backend.exe`."
msgstr "出力: `target/release/kanade-backend.exe`。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:57
#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/client.md:38
#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/nats.md:68
msgid "2. Publish the binary"
msgstr "2. バイナリを publish"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:63
msgid ""
"This uploads the binary to `OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES/kanade-backend/0.43.0` and "
"prints the sha-256 digest. **Copy the digest** — you'll need its lowercase-"
"hex form for the script."
msgstr ""
"これでバイナリが `OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES/kanade-backend/0.43.0` にアップロードさ"
"れ、sha-256 digest が表示されます。**digest を控えておきましょう** — 後でスク"
"リプトに lowercase-hex 形式で書き込みます。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:67
msgid "3. Edit `scripts/deploy/backend.ps1`"
msgstr "3. `scripts/deploy/backend.ps1` を編集"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:69
msgid "Make a local copy. Set the four `$Agent*` knobs at the top:"
msgstr "ローカルコピーを作って、先頭の 4 つの `$Agent*` ノブをセットします:"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:71
msgid ""
"```powershell\n"
"$AgentSourceUrl       = 'http://kanade-backend.example.com:8080'\n"
"$AgentSourceVersion   = '0.43.0'\n"
"$AgentSourceSha256    = '<lowercase hex of kanade-backend.exe>'\n"
"$AgentSourceAuthToken = '<bearer for the backend HTTP API>'\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```powershell\n"
"$AgentSourceUrl       = 'http://kanade-backend.example.com:8080'\n"
"$AgentSourceVersion   = '0.43.0'\n"
"$AgentSourceSha256    = '<kanade-backend.exe の lowercase hex>'\n"
"$AgentSourceAuthToken = '<backend HTTP API 用 bearer>'\n"
"```"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:78
msgid ""
"Leave the rest of the script alone — those knobs are how the script knows "
"it's running in \"agent mode\" (downloading from the backend) vs the manual-"
"install mode (local folder of files)."
msgstr ""
"スクリプトの他の部分は触らないでください。このノブによって「agent モード」"
"(backend からダウンロード) と「手動インストールモード」(ローカルフォルダから"
"の読み込み) が切り替わります。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:82
msgid ""
"The `$AgentSourceSha256` is the hex form of `Get-FileHash kanade-backend.exe "
"-Algorithm SHA256`."
msgstr ""
"`$AgentSourceSha256` は `Get-FileHash kanade-backend.exe -Algorithm SHA256` "
"の hex 形式の値です。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:85
msgid ""
"If you only have the base64url form printed by `kanade app publish`, decode "
"it. The base64 from the CLI is URL-safe and may be unpadded, so the "
"PowerShell snippet needs to re-pad before `FromBase64String` accepts it:"
msgstr ""
"`kanade app publish` の出力にある base64url 形式しか手元にない場合は decode "
"します。CLI から出る base64 は URL-safe で padding なしのことがあるので、"
"`FromBase64String` に通す前に padding を補う必要があります:"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:97
msgid ""
"Or in Python: `python -c \"import base64; "
"print(base64.urlsafe_b64decode('<b64>' + '=' * (-len('<b64>') % 4)).hex())\"`"
msgstr ""
"Python の場合: `python -c \"import base64; "
"print(base64.urlsafe_b64decode('<b64>' + '=' * (-len('<b64>') % 4)).hex())\"`"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:100
msgid ""
"The `$AgentSourceAuthToken` is required as of the live test on 2026-05-26 — "
"the backend's `/api/app-packages/<name>/<ver>` endpoint returns HTTP 401 "
"without it. Leave empty only for no-auth lab setups."
msgstr ""
"`$AgentSourceAuthToken` は 2026-05-26 の live test 以降必須です。backend の "
"`/api/app-packages/<name>/<ver>` エンドポイントは token なしだと HTTP 401 を"
"返します。auth なしの lab 環境のときだけ空のままで問題ありません。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:105
msgid "4. Publish the edited script"
msgstr "4. 編集したスクリプトを publish"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:111
msgid "Upload goes to `OBJECT_SCRIPTS/deploy-backend/0.43.0`."
msgstr "アップロード先は `OBJECT_SCRIPTS/deploy-backend/0.43.0`。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:113
msgid "5. Register / update the job"
msgstr "5. ジョブを登録 / 更新"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:115
msgid ""
"`configs/jobs/installers/install-kanade-backend.yaml` in the repo is the "
"template. Edit `version:` + `script_object:` to point at the version you "
"just published, then upsert:"
msgstr ""
"リポジトリの `configs/jobs/installers/install-kanade-backend.yaml` がテンプ"
"レートです。`version:` と `script_object:` をいま publish したバージョンに合"
"わせて編集してから upsert:"

