#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:138
msgid "6. Fire it"
msgstr "6. 起動"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:144
msgid ""
"The CLI returns an `exec_id` immediately. The actual install happens "
