"```pwsh\n"
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\" `\n"
"  \"http://<backend>/api/results?limit=5\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```pwsh\n"
"curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\" `\n"
"  \"http://<backend>/api/results?limit=5\"\n"
"```"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:157
msgid ""
"Look for your `exec_id` with `exit_code: 0` and a `stdout` that ends with "
