msgstr "ジョブは実行されたが kanade-backend が起動してこない"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:168
msgid "Service-failure / config drift on target"
msgstr "対象ホストでのサービス起動失敗 / config の不整合"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/backend.md:168
msgid ""
"Read `C:\\ProgramData\\Kanade\\log\\backend.*.log` on the target. The agent "
"can fetch it via `kanade logs <pc>` (when implemented) or you can pull the "
"file directly."
msgstr ""
"対象ホストの `C:\\ProgramData\\Kanade\\log\\backend.*.log` を読む。agent 経由"
"で `kanade logs <pc>` で取れる (実装後) か、直接ファイルを引き上げる。"

#: src\operations/agent-mediated-updates/client.md:3
msgid ""
"The Tauri desktop client is shipped to endpoints the same way as the "
"backend: binary in `OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES`, script in `OBJECT_SCRIPTS`, job in "
"`jobs` KV. The shape mirrors [backend updates](./backend.md) — only the "
"script content and package name differ."
msgstr ""
